    npx:supersedes <https://w3id.org/np/RAo59QCb0U2xhqkbLo4joZxUnRpX3GEYeuxC1-Qj7YSI8>;
    skos:changeNote "Pick the newest declaration by argmax instead of a filter on the rank, and keep a required pattern (?property a rdf:Property) in the assertion-graph block: with only optional patterns there, RDF4J sometimes plans the query so that rows are lost (seen on the sibling classes query).";
